 r←Test_Busy_007(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;parms;msg;noOfThreads
⍝ Exercise `Busy` with an "Abort" button. Checks the behaviour with threads doing heavy stuff.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 #.TEMP←#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.f←⎕NEW'Form'(('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(35 55))('Size'(600 900))('Caption' 'Busy: Test Busy 5'))

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'This is "Busy" test no 5'
 parms.centerIn←#.TEMP.f
 parms.onTop←1
 parms.hasAbortButton←1
 parms.align←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.Align.Center

 msg←'This may take a moment' 'Please stay patient' 'It won''t last forever'
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.Create msg
 #.TEMP.tnos←{_←+/,0.2×100 100⍴1000 ⋄ ∇ ⍵}&¨⍳100

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS

 :For i :In 2+⍳9
     :If 5=i
         ⎕NQ n.AbortBtn'Select'
     :EndIf
     ⎕DL 0.5
     :If 0=n.∆ABORTED
         n #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.SetPercent 10×i
     :Else
         →GoToTidyUp n.∆ABORTED≠1
         :Leave
     :EndIf
 :EndFor

 n.∆CloseForm
 →GoToTidyUp(noOfThreads-1)≠⍴⎕TNUMS
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}⎕TKILL #.TEMP.tnos ⋄ :EndTrap
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}#.TEMP.f.Close ⍬ ⋄ :EndTrap
 n.∆CloseForm
